    "STSA 於新加坡正式成立" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Formally established in Singapore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "STSA 隸屬世學聯（WWTSA）旗下支分會。世學聯為世界性學生組織，服務全球海外台灣留學生與各地 TSA，並為台灣社會貢獻諸多公益。以促進良性競爭、人才回流為願景，增加與世界接軌的機會。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "STSA is a chapter of the World Wide Taiwanese Student Association, a global body serving Taiwanese students overseas and the TSAs they belong to, with a wider public-service mission back home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "token 只在有請求時更新，不是定時更新，所以閒置時顯示已過期是正常的。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tokens refresh on request rather than on a timer, so an expired one while idle is normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
