    "否" : {

    },
    "因此我們成立新加坡台灣學生總會，主要目的是串聯在新加坡的異鄉遊子對家鄉的情感，舉辦各類活動增進台灣學生間的交流、凝聚台灣精神，同時在當地推廣台灣的美食與文化，並歡迎來自世界各地的學生。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So we founded the Singapore Taiwanese Student Association instead: to connect Taiwanese students far from home, run events that bring them together, and share Taiwanese food and culture in Singapore — with students from anywhere welcome to join us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「設定」中允許 STSA 使用相機,就可以掃描會員卡。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
